menu "Daily Mirror settings defaults"

    comment "Build-time fallbacks used only when NVS has no value."
    comment "Leave empty in git; set them in a git-ignored sdkconfig for bench builds."

    config MIRROR_DEFAULT_WIFI_SSID
        string "Default Wi-Fi SSID"
        default ""
        help
            Used when no SSID has been stored through the /config page.
            Keep this empty in anything committed to the repository.

    config MIRROR_DEFAULT_WIFI_PASS
        string "Default Wi-Fi password"
        default ""
        help
            Used when no password has been stored through the /config page.
            This ends up in the firmware image in plain text, so set it only in
            a git-ignored sdkconfig on a bench build, never in source control.

    config MIRROR_DEFAULT_SERVER_URL
        string "Default server URL"
        default ""
        help
            Base URL uploads are sent to, e.g. https://mirror.example.com.
            Must start with http:// or https:// when non-empty.

    config MIRROR_DEFAULT_UPLOAD_TOKEN
        string "Default upload token"
        default ""
        help
            Bearer token for the upload server. Same warning as the Wi-Fi
            password: a build-time default is baked into the image.

endmenu
